### Request OTP - demo patient
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{"phoneNumber":"+919999999001"}

### Verify OTP - replace 123456 with devOtp
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"phoneNumber":"+919999999001","otp":"123456"}

### Emergency lookup - replace TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8000/api/emergency/critical-info/PHR-IN-000001
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Patient records - patient UUID or Health ID accepted
GET http://localhost:8000/api/records?patientId=PHR-IN-000001
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### QR validation
POST http://localhost:8000/api/qr/validate
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"healthId":"PHR-IN-000001","payloadHash":"72db86337dcf9d91fc1fb3f8f0edf5aeadfa81528ad329839158f2e2e4b14160"}

### Consent request - requires doctor token
POST http://localhost:8000/api/consent/request
Authorization: Bearer DOCTOR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"patientId":"PHR-IN-000001","purpose":"Clinical consultation"}
